{"root":"tampar","ipa":"/tampar/","core":"用手掌拍击，打耳光","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tampar/","zh":"用手掌拍击，打耳光","phrases":[{"t":"tampar muka","zh":"打脸"},{"t":"kena tampar","zh":"挨耳光"},{"t":"tampar keras","zh":"重重地打一巴掌"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia menampar pipi temannya karena marah.","zh":"他因为生气打了朋友的脸。"},{"t":"Jangan suka menampar orang lain.","zh":"不要动不动就打别人的耳光。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tampar","ipa":"/tampar/","zh":"打耳光（动作原型）","phrase":{"t":"tampar pipi","zh":"打脸颊"},"example":{"t":"Dia ingin tampar orang itu.","zh":"他想打那个人一巴掌。"}},{"w":"menampar","ipa":"/mənampar/","zh":"打（某人）耳光","phrase":{"t":"menampar wajah","zh":"扇脸"},"example":{"t":"Ibu menampar anaknya karena nakal.","zh":"母亲因为孩子淘气而打了他一巴掌。"}},{"w":"tamparan","ipa":"/tamparan/","zh":"耳光，打击","phrase":{"t":"tamparan keras","zh":"沉重的打击"},"example":{"t":"Kejadian itu menjadi tamparan bagi dirinya.","zh":"那件事对他来说是一个沉重的打击。"}},{"w":"tertampar","ipa":"/tərtampar/","zh":"被意外打到，被扇到","phrase":{"t":"tertampar tidak sengaja","zh":"不小心被扇到"},"example":{"t":"Wajahnya tertampar saat mereka berkelahi.","zh":"他们在打架时，他的脸被意外扇到了。"}}],"derSlugs":["tampar","menampar","tamparan","tertampar"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T02:41:04.226Z","src":"base"}